{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["犹大百姓的厄运"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说：「虽有摩西和撒母耳站在我面前代求，我的心也不顾惜这百姓。你将他们从我眼前赶出，叫他们去吧！"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他们问你说：『我们往哪里去呢？』你便告诉他们，耶和华如此说：",{"text":"定为死亡的，必致死亡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定为刀杀的，必交刀杀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定为饥荒的，必遭饥荒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定为掳掠的，必被掳掠。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华说：「我命定四样害他们，就是刀剑杀戮、狗类撕裂、空中的飞鸟，和地上的野兽吞吃毁灭；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["又必使他们在天下万国中抛来抛去，都因犹大王希西家的儿子玛拿西在耶路撒冷所行的事。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，谁可怜你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁为你悲伤呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁转身问你的安呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：你弃绝了我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"转身退后；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我伸手攻击你，毁坏你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我后悔甚不耐烦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在境内各城门口","poem":1},{"noteId":20},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用簸箕簸了我的百姓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们丧掉儿女。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我毁灭他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们仍不转离所行的道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的寡妇在我面前比海沙更多；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使灭命的午间来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻击少年人的母亲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使痛苦惊吓忽然临到她身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生过七子的妇人力衰气绝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尚在白昼，日头忽落；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她抱愧蒙羞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其余的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在他们敌人跟前，交与刀剑。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米向耶和华诉苦"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我的母亲哪，我有祸了！因你生我作为遍地相争相竞的人。我素来没有借贷与人，人也没有借贷与我，人人却都咒骂我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华说：「我必要坚固你，使你得好处。灾祸苦难临到的时候，我必要使仇敌央求你。（"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["人岂能将铜与铁，就是北方的铁折断呢？）"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「我必因你在四境之内所犯的一切罪，把你的货物财宝当掠物，白白地交给仇敌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我也必使仇敌带这掠物到你所不认识的地去，因我怒中起的火要将你们焚烧。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，你是知道的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你记念我，眷顾我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向逼迫我的人为我报仇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要向他们忍怒取我的命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要知道我为你的缘故受了凌辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华—万军之 神啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我得着你的言语就当食物吃了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的言语是我心中的欢喜快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我是称为你名下的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我没有坐在宴乐人的会中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有欢乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因你的感动","poem":1},{"noteId":21},{"text":"独自静坐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你使我满心愤恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的痛苦为何长久不止呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的伤痕为何无法医治、不能痊愈呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你待我有诡诈，像流干的河道吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：你若归回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就将你再带来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你站在我面前；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若将宝贵的和下贱的分别出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就可以当作我的口。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必归向你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你却不可归向他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使你向这百姓成为坚固的铜墙；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必攻击你，却不能胜你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我与你同在，要拯救你，搭救你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必搭救你脱离恶人的手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救赎你脱离强暴人的手。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":20,"caller":"-","text":"或译：我在这地边界的关口","reference":{"chapter":15,"verse":7}},{"noteId":21,"caller":"-","text":"原文是手","reference":{"chapter":15,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}